    <data key="d0">FanFight Daily Fantasy Sports Data Ingestion and Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WgTBTDlQN8</data>
    <data key="d2">FanFight uses API Gateway, Lambda, MongoDB, S3, EMR, and Redshift to process live fantasy sports data and user leaderboards at scale.</data>
